<!-- Hero -->
<div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M6 4v4M4 6h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        C++ · Python · CLI
    </div>
    <h1>liburlparser Documentation</h1>
    <p class="hero-desc">
        A high-performance, RFC 3986-compliant URL parsing library written in C++, with a Python
        extension and a command-line tool built on the same core. Extracts protocol, host, domain,
        subdomain, suffix, path, query, and fragment — with accurate Public Suffix List based domain
        extraction, and native IPv4/IPv6 host support.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="hero-stat">
            <div class="hero-stat-num">C++17</div>
            <div class="hero-stat-label">Core language</div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stat-div"></div>
        <div class="hero-stat">
            <div class="hero-stat-num">2</div>
            <div class="hero-stat-label">Language bindings</div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stat-div"></div>
        <div class="hero-stat">
            <div class="hero-stat-num">MIT</div>
            <div class="hero-stat-label">License</div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stat-div"></div>
        <div class="hero-stat">
            <div class="hero-stat-num">3.19+</div>
            <div class="hero-stat-label">CMake required</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">

<!-- API References -->
<div class="section">
    <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-label">API References</div>
        <div class="section-title">Language Documentation</div>
        <div class="section-desc">Full API reference for each language binding, generated from source.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="tabbed-panel" id="docs-panel">
        <div class="tab-bar" id="docs-tabs">
            <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="docs-cli" onclick="switchTab('docs','cli')">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-terminal"></i> CLI
            </button>
            <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="docs-cpp" onclick="switchTab('docs','cpp')">
                <svg class="tab-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg> C++
            </button>
            <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="docs-python" onclick="switchTab('docs','python')">
                <i class="fa-brands fa-python"></i> Python
            </button>
        </div>

        <div class="tab-content" id="docs-cpp">
            <div class="doc-card-inner">
                <div class="doc-card-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="doc-card-body">
                    <div class="doc-card-title">C++ API <span class="card-badge">C++17</span></div>
                    <p class="doc-card-desc">Core library. Covers <code>urlparser::url</code> and <code>urlparser::host</code> (with <code>hostname</code>, <code>ipv4</code>, and <code>ipv6</code> host variants), the lazily-loaded <code>urlparser::psl</code> Public Suffix List, and every accessor for protocol, userinfo, path, query, and fragment.</p>
                    <div class="doc-card-meta"><span class="doc-meta-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-book"></i> Generated with Doxygen</span></div>
                    <a href="cpp/html/index.html" class="doc-card-btn">Open C++ Reference <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tab-content" id="docs-python">
            <div class="doc-card-inner">
                <div class="doc-card-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="doc-card-body">
                    <div class="doc-card-title">Python API <span class="card-badge">Python 3.10+</span></div>
                    <p class="doc-card-desc">nanobind-based extension module exposing <code>Url</code>, <code>Host</code>, <code>Hostname</code>, <code>IPv4</code>, and <code>IPv6</code> with the same interface as the C++ core, plus the <code>liburlparser.utils</code> helpers. Ships pre-built wheels for Linux, macOS, and Windows.</p>
                    <div class="doc-card-meta"><span class="doc-meta-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-book"></i> Generated with Sphinx</span></div>
                    <a href="python/html/index.html" class="doc-card-btn">Open Python Reference <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tab-content active" id="docs-cli">
            <div class="doc-card-inner">
                <div class="doc-card-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="doc-card-body">
                    <div class="doc-card-title">CLI Reference <span class="card-badge">v@PROJECT_VERSION@</span></div>
                    <p class="doc-card-desc">Command-line tool for parsing a URL or a bare host straight from the terminal via <code>python -m liburlparser</code>. Covers <code>--url</code>, <code>--host</code>, field selection with <code>--parts</code>, and JSON output.</p>
                    <div class="doc-card-meta"><span class="doc-meta-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-lines"></i> Written in Markdown</span></div>
                    <a href="cli/index.html" class="doc-card-btn">Open CLI Reference <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
